WEBVTT

00:43:25.802 --> 00:43:30.449
My best example of it
is when I first met him,

00:43:30.473 --> 00:43:34.141
it was right after I had left law
and had just started writing.

00:43:34.165 --> 00:43:37.436
And at that time, it was before
I was writing "Quiet."

00:43:37.460 --> 00:43:39.851
I was working on this memoir
in sonnet form.

00:43:39.875 --> 00:43:42.193
And so I had just written a few poems

00:43:42.217 --> 00:43:45.792
and he was on the verge of publishing
this best-selling memoir

00:43:45.816 --> 00:43:47.865
about his years as a UN peacekeeper,

00:43:47.889 --> 00:43:49.613
and I had just written a few poems.

00:43:49.637 --> 00:43:54.327
And we went out on this date,
and afterwards I showed him the poems.

00:43:54.351 --> 00:43:57.739
So he sent me this email
and it was in this gigantic font,

00:43:57.763 --> 00:44:01.759
like, 65-size font or something,
all in red, and it said something like,